c_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ksp7J0iTiaQQ7kNvwEZ8fYS&_nc_oc=Adr4PS_vobGTZRR8LEGu9Sc1T0nYgjLTX9ZVLMu7bbfIODduowMIqjtQYzfLK9yNZSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNS_pdFvZvPz1qmIwR4hhgtVJbNEDhR87TXs8um5N3NWA&oe=6AE60E2F"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.SurgicalTech-20260218-193554.png", "id": "876512045220380", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_876512048553713_133527929692827975_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LGenWzA51HcQ7kNvwEkzzm6&_nc_oc=AdrWj1sRSwri5dH3o-W3Ughu7qBbCiozabCIHhnZ0SvKN6fjpfR6nteDofR27nRnTD4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMOoHDrEB8xOmOfgqaTL5jUtwytM0PBH7SycKmmaAP0hQ&oe=6AE5F718"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Surgical Technology", "keywords": ["Surgical", "tech", "immerselearn", "VR", "training"], "long_description": "Short Description (\u2264500 characters):\nSurgical Technology is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it provides hands-on practice in surgical procedures, instrument handling, sterile techniques, and operating room protocols within a realistic virtual environment.\n\nLong Description (\u22641000 characters):\nSurgical Technology is part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This immersive VR simulation delivers realistic, hands-on training in essential surgical technology skills and operating room procedures. Learners can practice sterile techniques, surgical instrument identification and handling, operating room preparation, and workflow coordination in a safe, interactive environment. Designed to align with industry and educational standards, the app helps students strengthen technical accuracy, safety compliance, and confidence before entering real-world clinical settings. Surgical Technology 